  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HUM, Response to the earthquake in the Northern Area in Syria, 23, LBN200082, GK11546</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The response to the earthquake in the Northern Area in Syria is done by our current partner inside Syria, Middle East Council of Churches (MECC), who has operated in Syria since 2011, and supported by our Plan Country Office in Lebanon. MECC will meet the needs of people currently staying in church halls and public schools with lifesaving needs such as provision of food, water, fuel, NFIs, winterization, medicines, and hygiene kits for 6 months as well as also assessing the long term needs of affected people, which will include education and child protection in emergencies and rehabilitation of homes and businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
